# Loading and skeleton

Ported from SmartRx patient `lib/core/widgets/skeleton/` (Dog handoff). Bnood paths only.

## Kit

`lib/core/widgets/skeleton/`:

- `Skeleton` — cosine pulse 0.55–1.0, `AppMotion.skeletonPulse` (1600ms), wall-clock sync, reduced motion → full opacity static
- `SkeletonBox` / `SkeletonText` — `surfaceSunken` / `outlineSubtle`, superellipse corners (`AppShape`) except pills/circles
- `AsyncValueBody` — skeleton **only** when no cached `valueOrNull`; silent reload always shows last data
- Home data: `SilentAsyncNotifier.refreshSilently()` + `refreshHomeDashboard(ref)` (not `invalidate` after first load)

Do **not** use SmartRx `AppSkeletonizer` / `AppBone` on new Bnood UI.

## Wiring

- Feature placeholder (e.g. `home_loading_skeleton.dart`) mirrors loaded **section structure** inside real `AppCard` chrome.
- **Live chrome** outside pulse: app title, settings, section headers, “See all”, nav dock.
- One scroll parent; bones are `Column` children, not nested `ListView`.
- Do not skeleton primary actions or nav.

See project skill `.cursor/skills/loading-skeleton/SKILL.md`.
